如果是你自己开发的游戏，可以实现合法的**调试透视**：直接访问游戏内实体列表，将世界坐标转换为屏幕坐标，再绘制方框或标记，无需读取外部进程内存。例如在 Unity 中：

```csharp
using UnityEngine;

public class DebugEnemyOverlay : MonoBehaviour
{
    [SerializeField] private Camera gameCamera;

    private void OnGUI()
    {
        if (gameCamera == null)
            gameCamera = Camera.main;

        foreach (var enemy in GameObject.FindGameObjectsWithTag("Enemy"))
        {
            Vector3 screen = gameCamera.WorldToScreenPoint(
                enemy.transform.position + Vector3.up
            );

            if (screen.z <= 0)
                continue;

            float x = screen.x;
            float y = Screen.height - screen.y;

            GUI.color = Color.red;
            GUI.Label(new Rect(x - 40, y - 20, 100, 24), enemy.name);
            GUI.Box(new Rect(x - 20, y - 50, 40, 60), GUIContent.none);
        }
    }
}
```

挂载到场景对象，并给敌人设置 `Enemy` 标签即可。
